{
  "schema": "director-scene-talk-rules/1",
  "note": "How a scene with a purpose picks the player's path. Moves only, no sentence. `moveActs` maps each reply move to the act kinds the trait engine scores (data/content/trait-act-pulls.json): a reply move is leaned toward when the player's traits pull toward its acts. Nothing here is a roll; a tie goes to the stable hash of the scene.",
